als</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggdWnviQTdX_text","label":"ggdWnviQTdX_text","default":"<p>78% FULVIC ACID</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfoyCNjRYP_text","label":"ggfoyCNjRYP_text","default":"<p>NATA-APPROVED</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg_1Bq8g9s1_text","label":"gg_1Bq8g9s1_text","default":"<p>GPM CERTIFIED</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfchpImdmD_text","label":"ggfchpImdmD_text","default":"<p>NON-GMO +&nbsp;</p><p>VEGAN FRIENDLY</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfJHeVaZkV_text","label":"ggfJHeVaZkV_text","default":"<p>84+ Minerals</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggQdzmIhzbw_text","label":"ggQdzmIhzbw_text","default":"<p>78% FULVIC ACID</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggFLKK40Ggj_text","label":"ggFLKK40Ggj_text","default":"<p>NATA-APPROVED</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzfY9whzkd_text","label":"ggzfY9whzkd_text","default":"<p>GPM CERTIFIED</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnNl-MTCrz_text","label":"ggnNl-MTCrz_text","default":"<p>NON-GMO +&nbsp;</p><p>VEGAN FRIENDLY</p>"}],
